"the B<info> and B<abc2ly> programs are properly installed at your site, the "
"command"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<info abc2ly>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "should give you access to the complete manual."
msgstr ""

